{"title": "Magic Allergy: Force explosion", "pageid": 49974, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Magic_Allergy:_Force_explosion", "categories": ["Class actions", "Sources of Force damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Force.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Generic_Force.webp/300px-Generic_Force.webp, /w/images/8/82/Generic_Force.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Generic_Force.webp/300px-Generic_Force.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/82/Generic_Force.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Magic Allergy: Force explosion</b> is one of the random actions used by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gremishka\" title=\"Gremishka\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Portrait_Gremishka.png/25px-Portrait_Gremishka.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Portrait_Gremishka.png/38px-Portrait_Gremishka.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Portrait_Gremishka.png/50px-Portrait_Gremishka.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gremishka\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Portrait_Gremishka.png/25px-Portrait_Gremishka.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Portrait_Gremishka.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gremishka\" title=\"Gremishka\">Gremishka</a> when its <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File